      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$P\left( {- 2,1,0}) \right.$$ , $$Q\left( {5,2, - 3}) \right.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$\langle{- 2 + 7t,1 + t, - 3t}\rangle$$ , $$0 \leqslant t \leqslant 1$$ ; $$x = - 2 + 7t$$ , $$y = 1 + t$$ , $$z = - 3t$$ , $$0 \leqslant t \leqslant 1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
